<title>SRI LANKA: Port conditions update - Sri Lanka - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Sri Lanka - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>SRI LANKA, April 11 - Colombo - 26 Vessels working import and 12 awaiting berths. Expected low labour attendance April 13/14. This will effect breakbulk vesels.</p>
</text>
